    <technology>
      <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>94% of iron waste goes for recycling. &#13;
Considering a recycling efficiency of 88%, 6% goes for municipal incineration. &#13;
The process permits obtaining liquid steel, which can substitute primary liquid steel.  &#13;
&#13;
Good the Reliability;   &#13;
Very Good the Geographical representativeness;   &#13;
Very Good the Time representativeness;   &#13;
Very Good the Technological representativeness. </technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
